        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(urnetwork_extender_camouflage_client_outcomes_total{env=\"$env\",outcome=\"camouflage_won\"}[1h])) / sum(increase(urnetwork_extender_camouflage_client_outcomes_total{env=\"$env\",outcome=~\"camouflage_won|legacy_won|both_failed\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "camouflage won"
        }
      ],
      "description": "camouflage_won over camouflage_won, legacy_won and both_failed, over the last hour: the compatible-client connection success of readiness gate 3 in EXTENDER-SPLICE-ROLLOUT.md, read against the baseline recorded for the cohort. Clients that cannot reach the api to report are not in this number, and one whose report was given up is not either, so a real outage reads better here than it is: read it beside both_failed by country and the release denials on the extenders dashboard."
    },
